{
  "sn48.43:0.1": "Linked Discourses 48.43 ",
  "sn48.43:0.2": "5. Old Age ",
  "sn48.43:0.3": "At Sāketa ",
  "sn48.43:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "sn48.43:1.2": "At one time the Buddha was staying near Sāketa in the deer park at the Añjana Wood. ",
  "sn48.43:1.3": "There the Buddha addressed the mendicants: ",
  "sn48.43:1.4": "“Mendicants, is there a method in which the five faculties become the five powers, and the five powers become the five faculties?” ",
  "sn48.43:2.1": "“Our teachings are rooted in the Buddha. He is our guide and our refuge. Sir, may the Buddha himself please clarify the meaning of this. The mendicants will listen and remember it.” ",
  "sn48.43:3.1": "“Mendicants, there is a method in which the five faculties become the five powers, and the five powers become the five faculties. ",
  "sn48.43:4.1": "And what is that method? ",
  "sn48.43:4.2": "The faculty of faith is the power of faith, and the power of faith is the faculty of faith. ",
  "sn48.43:4.3": "The faculty of energy is the power of energy, and the power of energy is the faculty of energy. ",
  "sn48.43:4.4": "The faculty of mindfulness is the power of mindfulness, and the power of mindfulness is the faculty of mindfulness. ",
  "sn48.43:4.5": "The faculty of immersion is the power of immersion, and the power of immersion is the faculty of immersion. ",
  "sn48.43:4.6": "The faculty of wisdom is the power of wisdom, and the power of wisdom is the faculty of wisdom. ",
  "sn48.43:4.7": "Suppose there was a riv